{"ayah/88-3.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-Ghaashiya 88:3 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"sich abarbeitend und von Mühsal erfüllt,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/88-3.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-Ghaashiya 88:3 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"sich abarbeitend und von Mühsal erfüllt,\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Startseite\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ghaashiya\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/88.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Vers 3\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-3.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/88.html\">Sura Al-Ghaashiya</a> › Vers 3</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-Ghaashiya 88:3</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿عَامِلَةٌ نَّاصِبَةٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">sich abarbeitend und von Mühsal erfüllt,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ومعلوم أنه إنما وصفها بالنعمة يوم القيامة لا في الدنيا؛ إذ هذا ليس بمدح فالواجب تشابه الكلام وتناظر القسمين لا اختلافهما<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/218</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s88a3\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/de/ayah/88-17.html\">Nächster Vers (88:17)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/88-17.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-Ghaashiya 88:17 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Schauen sie denn nicht zu den Kamelen, wie sie erschaffen worden sind,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/88-17.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-Ghaashiya 88:17 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Schauen sie denn nicht zu den Kamelen, wie sie erschaffen worden sind,\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Startseite\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ghaashiya\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/88.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Vers 17\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-17.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/88.html\">Sura Al-Ghaashiya</a> › Vers 17</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-Ghaashiya 88:17</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿أَفَلَا يَنظُرُونَ إِلَى الْإِبِلِ كَيْفَ خُلِقَتْ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">Schauen sie denn nicht zu den Kamelen, wie sie erschaffen worden sind,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإذا تأمل هذه الأشياء استبان فيها أثر الصنعة ولطف الحكمة -مما جمع الله له من المرافق فيها- أن صانعها لطيف خبير، عالم قدير، حكيم عليم.<cite>«بيان تلبيس الجهمية في تأسيس بدعهم الكلامية» 1/507</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s88a17\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/88-3.html\">Vorheriger Vers (88:3)</a><a href=\"/de/ayah/88-21.html\">Nächster Vers (88:21)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/88-21.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-Ghaashiya 88:21 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"So ermahne; du bist nur ein Ermahner.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/88-21.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-Ghaashiya 88:21 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"So ermahne; du bist nur ein Ermahner.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Startseite\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ghaashiya\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/88.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Vers 21\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-21.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/88.html\">Sura Al-Ghaashiya</a> › Vers 21</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-Ghaashiya 88:21</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَذَكِّرْ إِنَّمَا أَنتَ مُذَكِّرٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">So ermahne; du bist nur ein Ermahner.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وكذلك قوله: {فذكر إنما أنت مذكر لست عليهم بمصيطر} [الغاشية: 21 - 22] فقوله: {لست عليهم بمصيطر} لم ينف كونه مع التذكير مبشرا وهاديا وداعيا.<cite>«الرد على السبكي في مسألة تعليق الطلاق» 1/466</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s88a21\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/88-17.html\">Vorheriger Vers (88:17)</a><a href=\"/de/ayah/88-22.html\">Nächster Vers (88:22)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/88-22.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-Ghaashiya 88:22 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Du übst nicht die Oberherrschaft über sie aus.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-Ghaashiya 88:22 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Du übst nicht die Oberherrschaft über sie aus.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Startseite\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ghaashiya\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/88.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Vers 22\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-22.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/88.html\">Sura Al-Ghaashiya</a> › Vers 22</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-Ghaashiya 88:22</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿لَّسْتَ عَلَيْهِم بِمُصَيْطِرٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">Du übst nicht die Oberherrschaft über sie aus.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">لم ينف كونه مع التذكير مبشرا وهاديا وداعيا.<cite>«الرد على السبكي في مسألة تعليق الطلاق» 1/466</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا من المنقطع لا بالاعتبار الذي ذكره ابن خروف من كون المستثنى جملة مستقلة بل باعتبار آخر وهو أنه ليس المراد إثبات السيطرة على الكفار فإن الله سبحانه بعثه نذيرا مبلغا لرسالات ربه فمن أطاعة فله الجنة ومن عصاه فله النار<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote><h3>Was er von anderen überliefert hat</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">المفسرون</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «المعنى أنك لم ترسل مسلطا عليهم قاهرا لهم جبارا كالملوك بل أنت عبدي ورسولي المبلغ رسالاتي فمن أطاعك فله الجنة ومن عصاك فله النار»<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s88a22\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/88-21.html\">Vorheriger Vers (88:21)</a><a href=\"/de/ayah/88-23.html\">Nächster Vers (88:23)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/88-23.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-Ghaashiya 88:23 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Wer sich aber abkehrt und ungläubig ist,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-Ghaashiya 88:23 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Wer sich aber abkehrt und ungläubig ist,\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Startseite\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ghaashiya\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/88.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Vers 23\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-23.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/88.html\">Sura Al-Ghaashiya</a> › Vers 23</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-Ghaashiya 88:23</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِلَّا مَن تَوَلَّىٰ وَكَفَرَ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">Wer sich aber abkehrt und ungläubig ist,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا من المنقطع لا بالاعتبار الذي ذكره ابن خروف من كون المستثنى جملة مستقلة بل باعتبار آخر وهو أنه ليس المراد إثبات السيطرة على الكفار<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ويوضح هذا أن المخاطبين بهذا الخطاب هم الكفار فلا يصح أن يكونوا هم المستثنين.<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s88a23\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/88-22.html\">Vorheriger Vers (88:22)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/88.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Sura Al-Ghaashiya — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tafsir von Sura Al-Ghaashiya — Die Bedeutungen des Korans in den Worten von Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshai